// # Nine println string statements
//
// Logline: Print nine string literals so emit-wasm can plant all nine texts.
//
// Setup: One public main. Body is only nine println(STRING) statements.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Print line-a through line-e.
//   2. Print line-f through line-i.
//   3. Leave no other statements.

pub fn main() {
    println("line-a");
    println("line-b");
    println("line-c");
    println("line-d");
    println("line-e");
    println("line-f");
    println("line-g");
    println("line-h");
    println("line-i");
}
